## Article 72. Evidence in administrative cases

```catala
declaration scope Article72EvidenceOverview:
  input evidence content EvidenceItem
  output isEvidenceAdmissible content YesNo

scope Article72EvidenceOverview:
# Evidence must be relevant and obtained lawfully
  label admissible_default definition isEvidenceAdmissible equals No

  label admissible_both exception admissible_default
  definition isEvidenceAdmissible under condition
    evidence.isRelevant = Yes
    and evidence.obtainedLawfully = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label inadmissible_unlawful exception admissible_default
  definition isEvidenceAdmissible under condition
    evidence.obtainedLawfully = No
    consequence equals No
```

## Article 73. Types of evidence

```catala
declaration scope Article73EvidenceTypes:
  input evidence content EvidenceItem
  output isRecognizedEvidenceType content YesNo

scope Article73EvidenceTypes:
  label recognized_default definition isRecognizedEvidenceType equals No

  label recognized_documentary exception recognized_default
  definition isRecognizedEvidenceType under condition
    evidence.evidenceType = DocumentaryEvidence
    consequence equals Yes

  label recognized_physical exception recognized_default
  definition isRecognizedEvidenceType under condition
    evidence.evidenceType = PhysicalEvidence
    consequence equals Yes

  label recognized_expert exception recognized_default
  definition isRecognizedEvidenceType under condition
    evidence.evidenceType = ExpertOpinion
    consequence equals Yes

  label recognized_testimony exception recognized_default
  definition isRecognizedEvidenceType under condition
    evidence.evidenceType = WitnessTestimony
    consequence equals Yes

  label recognized_electronic exception recognized_default
  definition isRecognizedEvidenceType under condition
    evidence.evidenceType = ElectronicEvidence
    consequence equals Yes

  label recognized_inquiry exception recognized_default
  definition isRecognizedEvidenceType under condition
    evidence.evidenceType = OfficialInquiryResponse
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 74. Relevance of evidence

```catala
declaration scope Article74EvidenceRelevance:
  input evidence content EvidenceItem
  input relatesToCaseFacts content YesNo
  input corroboratesOrContradicts content YesNo
  output isRelevantEvidence content YesNo

scope Article74EvidenceRelevance:
  label relevant_default definition isRelevantEvidence equals No

  label relevant_facts exception relevant_default
  definition isRelevantEvidence under condition
    relatesToCaseFacts = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label relevant_corroboration exception relevant_default
  definition isRelevantEvidence under condition
    corroboratesOrContradicts = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 75. Admissibility of evidence

```catala
declaration scope Article75EvidenceAdmissibility:
  input evidence content EvidenceItem
  input obtainedByUnlawfulMeans content YesNo
  input violatesConstitutionalRights content YesNo
  output isFullyAdmissible content YesNo
  output evidenceMustBeExcluded content YesNo

scope Article75EvidenceAdmissibility:
# Evidence obtained unlawfully or violating constitutional rights must be excluded
  label exclude_unlawful definition evidenceMustBeExcluded under condition
    obtainedByUnlawfulMeans = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label exclude_constitutional definition evidenceMustBeExcluded under condition
    violatesConstitutionalRights = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label exclude_no definition evidenceMustBeExcluded under condition
    obtainedByUnlawfulMeans = No
    and violatesConstitutionalRights = No
    consequence equals No

  label admissible_yes definition isFullyAdmissible under condition
    evidenceMustBeExcluded = No
    and evidence.isRelevant = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label admissible_no definition isFullyAdmissible under condition
    evidenceMustBeExcluded = Yes
    consequence equals No
```

## Article 76. Burden of proof

```catala
declaration scope Article76BurdenOfProof:
  input disputeCategory content DisputeCategory
  input plaintiffChallengingAct content YesNo
  input defendantPublicAuthority content YesNo
  output whoBearsBurdenOfProof content BurdenOfProof

scope Article76BurdenOfProof:
# Default: plaintiff bears burden
  label burden_default definition whoBearsBurdenOfProof equals BurdenPlaintiff

# Individual act challenge: defendant authority must prove legality
  label burden_defendant exception burden_default
  definition whoBearsBurdenOfProof under condition
    disputeCategory = IndividualActChallenge
    and plaintiffChallengingAct = Yes
    consequence equals BurdenDefendant

# Action/inaction challenge: defendant must prove lawfulness
  label burden_defendant_action exception burden_default
  definition whoBearsBurdenOfProof under condition
    disputeCategory = ActionChallenge
    and defendantPublicAuthority = Yes
    consequence equals BurdenDefendant

  label burden_defendant_inaction exception burden_default
  definition whoBearsBurdenOfProof under condition
    disputeCategory = DisputeCategory.InactionChallenge
    and defendantPublicAuthority = Yes
    consequence equals BurdenDefendant

# Normative act: plaintiff must prove unlawfulness
  label burden_plaintiff_normative definition whoBearsBurdenOfProof under condition
    disputeCategory = NormativeActChallenge
    consequence equals BurdenPlaintiff
```

## Article 77. Obligation to present evidence

```catala
declaration scope Article77EvidencePresentation:
  input deadlineType content DeadlineType
  input evidenceSubmittedLate content YesNo
  input goodCauseForLateSubmission content YesNo
  output evidenceCanBeAccepted content YesNo

scope Article77EvidencePresentation:
  label accept_default definition evidenceCanBeAccepted equals No

  label accept_timely exception accept_default
  definition evidenceCanBeAccepted under condition
    evidenceSubmittedLate = No
    consequence equals Yes

  label accept_late_good_cause exception accept_default
  definition evidenceCanBeAccepted under condition
    evidenceSubmittedLate = Yes
    and goodCauseForLateSubmission = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Articles 78-80. Written evidence

```catala
declaration scope Article78WrittenEvidence:
  input documentContainsSealedInfo content YesNo
  input documentOriginalAvailable content YesNo
  input documentProperlyAuthenticated content YesNo
  output writtenEvidenceAdmissible content YesNo

scope Article78WrittenEvidence:
  label written_default definition writtenEvidenceAdmissible equals No

  label written_original exception written_default
  definition writtenEvidenceAdmissible under condition
    documentOriginalAvailable = Yes
    and documentProperlyAuthenticated = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label written_copy exception written_default
  definition writtenEvidenceAdmissible under condition
    documentOriginalAvailable = No
    and documentProperlyAuthenticated = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Articles 81-84. Expert opinion

```catala
declaration scope Article81ExpertOpinion:
  input expertQualified content YesNo
  input expertIndependent content YesNo
  input examinationWithinExpertise content YesNo
  output expertOpinionAdmissible content YesNo
  output mustAppointExpert content YesNo

scope Article81ExpertOpinion:
  label expert_admissible_default definition expertOpinionAdmissible equals No

  label expert_admissible exception expert_admissible_default
  definition expertOpinionAdmissible under condition
    expertQualified = Yes
    and expertIndependent = Yes
    and examinationWithinExpertise = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# Court must appoint expert when specialized knowledge required
  label must_appoint_default definition mustAppointExpert equals No

  label must_appoint exception must_appoint_default
  definition mustAppointExpert under condition
    examinationWithinExpertise = Yes
    and expertQualified = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Articles 85-87. Witness testimony

```catala
declaration scope Article85WitnessTestimony:
  input witnessHasPersonalKnowledge content YesNo
  input witnessIsParty content YesNo
  input witnessIsMinor content YesNo
  output canTestify content YesNo

scope Article85WitnessTestimony:
  label testify_default definition canTestify equals No

  label testify_personal_knowledge exception testify_default
  definition canTestify under condition
    witnessHasPersonalKnowledge = Yes
    and witnessIsParty = No
    consequence equals Yes

# Parties cannot be witnesses in their own case
  label testify_party exception testify_default
  definition canTestify under condition
    witnessIsParty = Yes
    consequence equals No

# Minors may testify with appropriate procedure
  label testify_minor exception testify_default
  definition canTestify under condition
    witnessHasPersonalKnowledge = Yes
    and witnessIsMinor = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 88. Court's official inquiry

```catala
declaration scope Article88OfficialInquiry:
  input courtNeedsInformation content YesNo
  input informationHeldByAuthority content YesNo
  input authorityRefusedToProvide content YesNo
  output courtCanRequestDirectly content YesNo

scope Article88OfficialInquiry:
  label inquiry_default definition courtCanRequestDirectly equals No

  label inquiry_exception exception inquiry_default
  definition courtCanRequestDirectly under condition
    courtNeedsInformation = Yes
    and informationHeldByAuthority = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Articles 89-90. Evidence evaluation

```catala
declaration scope Article89EvidenceEvaluation:
  input evidence content EvidenceItem
  input contradictoryEvidenceExists content YesNo
  input corroboratingEvidenceExists content YesNo
  output evidenceHasSufficientWeight content YesNo

scope Article89EvidenceEvaluation:
# Court evaluates evidence according to inner conviction based on comprehensive review
  label weight_default definition evidenceHasSufficientWeight equals No

  label weight_corroborated exception weight_default
  definition evidenceHasSufficientWeight under condition
    corroboratingEvidenceExists = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label weight_uncontradicted exception weight_default
  definition evidenceHasSufficientWeight under condition
    contradictoryEvidenceExists = No
    and evidence.isRelevant = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```
